  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 2501.09 Medical provider",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2501.09 “Medical provider” means a physician licensed to practice medicine in any state of the United States.\n\nSource. #13416, eff 7-25-22; ss by #14218, INTERIM, eff 3-25-25, EXPIRES: 9-21-25; ss by #14382, eff 9-20-25, EXPIRES: 9-20-35 (formerly Saf-C 2501.08)",
